UPDATE companies SET description='Amphenol Industrial Operations is headquartered in Endicott, New York. No founding year or founder names are disclosed in public materials.

The company produces circular power and signal connectors, cable assemblies, junction boxes, and value‑added box builds. Its portfolio includes proprietary RADSOK® contact technology for high‑amperage applications, ruggedized circular and rectangular interconnects, and board‑level contacts such as the GT, AC, PT, Amphe‑Lite, PowerBlok, SurLok Plus, ePower, UPC, H4 Plus, and UPT series. Over 2,500 employees work across eight manufacturing sites in North America, Asia‑Pacific, Europe, and the Middle East, supporting custom‑engineered cable assemblies and overmolded harnesses.

Customers span alternative energy (including solar), heavy equipment, energy storage, factory automation, eMobility, rail mass transit, datacom/telecom, data‑center power, and power distribution. The company supplies OEMs requiring harsh‑environment interconnects for diesel‑engine vehicles, battery and fuel‑cell systems, locomotives, and high‑density server power.

Amphenol Industrial emphasizes its global manufacturing footprint, regional technical and sales support, and design capabilities for harsh‑environment reliability as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Circular connector manufacturing", "Power/signal connector manufacturing", "Cable assembly", "Junction box fabrication", "Value-added box builds", "Custom-engineered cable assemblies", "Overmolded harnesses", "Board-level interconnects (board-to-board, wire-to-board, box-to-board)", "High-amperage power interconnects (500+ amps)", "RADSOK\u00ae contact technology integration", "Ruggedized and environmentally protected connector design", "Blind-mate and floating-mate connector design", "Solar connector manufacturing (H4, Amphe-PV)", "eMobility high-voltage connector manufacturing", "Rail mass transit interconnect solutions", "Data center power interconnects"], "industries": ["Alternative Energy", "Solar", "Heavy Equipment", "Energy Storage", "Factory Automation", "eMobility", "Rail Mass Transit", "Datacom/Telecom", "Data Center Power", "Power Distribution"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Proprietary RADSOK\u00ae contact technology for high\u2011amperage power interconnects", "Eight manufacturing sites across North America, Asia\u2011Pacific, Europe, and the Middle East", "Over 2,500 skilled staff providing design and regional technical support", "Value\u2011added box builds, custom cable assemblies, and overmolded harnesses", "Broad product portfolio covering circular, rectangular, and board\u2011level interconnects"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Endicott, New York -> db", "Manufacturer of circular connectors, power/signal connectors, cable assemblies, junction boxes -> /", "Proprietary RADSOK\u00ae contact technology -> /", "Over 2,500 skilled staff -> /", "Eight manufacturing sites in North America, Asia-Pacific, Europe, Middle East -> /", "Product li