UPDATE companies SET description='Angel Factory operates from Garland, Texas, in the Dallas metropolitan area. The company has been producing apparel since the early 1990s as a full-service sewing contractor.

The shop handles all types of men''s, women''s, and children''s clothing, offering in-house design, fabric cutting, reworking, embroidery, finishing, and packaging. It works with a broad range of textiles including cotton, knits, wovens, fleece, lycra, cotton lace, rayon, polyester, and pima cotton.

Angel Factory serves fashion designers and wholesalers who need cut-and-sew production for their lines. The company emphasizes that it accepts orders of any size, stating that no client is too big or too small.

