UPDATE companies SET description='Argus Apparel operates from Los Angeles, California, where all production is carried out in-house. The company does not disclose a founding year or ownership structure, and no founders are named in its public materials. It presents itself as a U.S.-based custom clothing manufacturer serving brands of all sizes.

