UPDATE companies SET description='Arieca Inc. operates from Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, where it develops advanced thermal interface materials for semiconductor cooling. The company’s patented Liquid Metal Embedded Elastomer (LMEE) technology is designed to deliver both high thermal conductivity and mechanical reliability across diverse semiconductor applications.

Beyond material supply, Arieca provides engineering services that span assembly process development, thermal performance testing, reliability testing, and transition to high-volume production partners. The team works directly with customers to create system-level thermal solutions that are manufacturable at scale, rather than offering standalone materials.

