UPDATE companies SET description='Arizona Solar Wave operates from Mesa, Arizona, where it has provided solar energy solutions for more than 25 years. The company was established to address the state''s growing energy challenges and is structured around a team of consultants, financing specialists, and installers who manage projects from assessment to commissioning.

The firm designs and installs photovoltaic systems for both residential and commercial properties, integrating battery storage and electric-vehicle charging infrastructure where required. A proprietary online tool, called Solar Wizard, helps customers estimate system size, potential savings, and environmental impact before a site visit.

Customers include homeowners seeking to reduce utility bills, businesses aiming to offset operational energy costs, and electric-vehicle owners who need charging capacity. The company''s marketing materials reference primary residences, commercial facilities, and EV owners as typical client segments.

