UPDATE companies SET description='Arkansas Diesel Engines operates from Little Rock, Arkansas, where it has served the diesel engine market for over two decades. The company was established as a remanufacturing supply business focused on diesel engine cores and components, though the exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

