UPDATE companies SET description='Artemis Electronics operates from Prospect, Kentucky, where it focuses on supporting legacy avionics and electronic systems for military customers. The company''s founding year and ownership structure have not been publicly disclosed, but it presents itself as a dedicated supporter of defense readiness.

