UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in Petal, Mississippi, by A.S. ''Skipper'' Herring about thirty years ago, ASH Millworks began as a custom millwork shop serving the local community. In 2021, Jimmy Reid and Jeremy Hall acquired the business, bringing a combined 30 years of home remodeling experience—Reid with an architectural background and Hall with a sales background—to continue the founder’s vision of quality wood products for South Mississippi.

