UPDATE companies SET description='Asheville Thermoform Plastics was founded in October 1998 by Bill Trometer in a 2,400-square-foot incubator facility in Fletcher, North Carolina. The family-owned and operated company began with a focus on dunnage and thin-gauge packaging trays made using hand-made molds and fixtures.

