UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in October 1977 in Gallatin, Tennessee, Associated Packaging, Inc. has grown into a national provider of end-of-line packaging solutions. The company operates 12 branches across the United States with over 140 packaging specialists serving customers from coast to coast.

