UPDATE companies SET description='Atico Furniture operates from a studio and showroom in Farmers Branch, Texas, a suburb of Dallas. The company was founded in 2011 when its principals began building handmade industrial furniture from leftover materials from a home reconstruction project. Ownership is held by Sarah Breitkreutz, who serves as Owner and Director of Sales, Marketing, and Client Relations, and William Howard, Operating Owner and President.

