UPDATE companies SET description='Autotiv Manufacturing operates from Salem, New Hampshire, providing digital manufacturing services that include 3D printing, CNC machining, injection molding, urethane casting, and sheet metal fabrication. The company emphasizes speed and flexibility, with over 200 machines available for production.

The shop runs a range of processes: 3D printing in plastics, metals, and elastomers with 1-day expedited options; CNC machining holding tolerances of ±0.001 inch; injection molding for plastics, elastomers, and liquid silicone rubber with insert and overmolding capabilities; urethane casting for rigid or flexible polyurethanes; and sheet metal fabrication covering 4- to 26-gauge thicknesses. It supports volumes from single prototypes to millions of parts.

Autotiv serves customers across various industries, though specific sectors are not listed on its site. The company highlights a blend of domestic production and a vetted global supply chain, offering instant interactive quotes for hundreds of materials and finishes backed by manufacturing engineers.

Autotiv differentiates itself with a Quality Guarantee, 1-day expedited 3D printing (with a 4:30 PM EST cutoff), free DFM simulation for molding, and a focus on cost-effective, resilient production. Its core values stress excellence, innovation, integrity, customer focus, and teamwork.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["3D printing (plastics, metals, elastomers)", "CNC machining (plastics, metals, composites)", "Injection molding (plastics, elastomers, LSR)", "Urethane casting (rigid/flexible polyurethanes)", "Sheet metal fabrication (cutting, bending, welding)", "Insert and overmolding", "Design for manufacturing (DFM) simulation", "Post-processing services"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Plastics", "Metals", "Elastomers", "Composites", "Liquid Silicone Rubber (LSR)", "Polyurethanes"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to millions of parts", "lead_time": "1-day expedited 3D printing; economy options available", "tolerances": "\u00b10.001 in (CNC machining)", "built_on": ["1-day expedited 3D printing with 4:30 PM EST cutoff", "Instant interactive quotes across hundreds of materials and finishes", "Quality Guarantee on all delivered parts", "Domestic and vetted global supply chain for CNC, molding, casting, and sheet metal", "Expert manufacturing engineering support"], "facts_used": ["Location: Salem, New Hampshire -> /about-us", "Over 200 machines -> /", "Services: 3D printing, CNC machining, injection molding, urethane casting, sheet metal fabrication -> /about-us", "3D printing: 1-day expedited, 4:30 PM EST cutoff, plastics/metals/elastomers, production runs from $0.07/part -> /", "CNC machining: plastics/metals/composites, tolerance \u00b10.001\", production runs from $0.70/part -> /", "Injection molding: plastics/elastomers/LSR, insert/overmolding, free DFM simulation, production runs from $0.01/part -> /", "Sheet metal: cutting/bending/welding, 4-26 gauge, production runs from $0.30/part -> /", "Urethane casting: rigid/flexibl