UPDATE companies SET description='Aved Electronics operates from Lowell, Massachusetts, as a brand under Lithion Battery Inc. The company focuses on custom power solutions for applications where reliability is critical.

Aved designs and manufactures custom battery packs, cable and harness assemblies, and electro-mechanical box builds. Its services span battery pack design and manufacturing, cable assembly, electro-mechanical integration, testing, and compliance support. The company states it is one of the largest custom battery pack manufacturers in the United States, with all production taking place at its Massachusetts facility.

The company serves customers ranging from start-ups to Fortune 500 firms across medical, military and defense, robotics, security, telecommunications, semiconductor, oceanographic research, homeland security, and industrial sectors. Its products are used in medical diagnosis, therapy, treatment, and surgery equipment, as well as in robotics and military operations.

Aved emphasizes a chemistry-agnostic approach, working with lithium-ion, primary lithium, nickel-metal hydride, and lead-acid cells. It maintains a quality management system certified to ISO 9001 and ISO 13485, and performs 100 percent testing on every battery produced. The company positions itself as a full-service custom battery solution designer, manufacturer, assembler, and tester, taking projects from prototype through production.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 13485']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom battery pack design and manufacturing", "Cable and harness assembly", "Electro-mechanical assembly and box build", "Prototype to production manufacturing", "Testing and compliance (ISO 9001, ISO 13485)", "Battery chemistry selection (Li-ion, primary lithium, NiMH, lead acid)"], "industries": ["Medical", "Military / Defense", "Robotics", "Security systems", "Telecommunications", "Semiconductor", "Oceanographic research", "Homeland security", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Lithium ion", "Primary lithium", "NiMH", "Lead acid"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house custom battery pack design and manufacturing", "ISO 9001 and ISO 13485 certified quality management system", "100% testing of every battery to performance and safety standards", "Chemistry-agnostic cell selection (Li-ion, primary lithium, NiMH, lead acid)", "Prototype-to-production electro-mechanical and box build capabilities"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Lowell, Massachusetts -> db", "Part of Lithion Battery Inc. -> page:/", "Designs and manufactures custom battery packs, cable assemblies, electro-mechanical systems -> page:/", "One of the largest custom battery pack manufacturers in the U.S. -> page:/", "All production at Massachusetts facility -> page:/", "ISO 9001 and ISO 13485 certified QMS -> page:/, db", "100% testing of every battery -> page:/", "Chemistry-agnostic: lithium ion, primary lithium, NiMH, lead acid -> page:/", "