UPDATE companies SET description='AZ Prototype, Inc. operates from a facility in Mesa, Arizona, where it was founded in 2009 as a woman‑owned private electronics contract manufacturer. The company began with a focus on providing flexible, quick‑turn manufacturing services for both prototype and production projects, aiming to deliver high‑quality, cost‑effective solutions.

The shop specializes in printed circuit board assembly, wire and cable harness assembly, and electro‑mechanical box builds. It runs MYDATA MY19 and YAMAHA YSM20 pick‑and‑place equipment, offers a 24‑ to 48‑hour quick‑turn prototype service, and maintains a flexible manufacturing schedule with no general inventory. Turnkey services cover the full product lifecycle from prototype to volume production.

AZ Prototype serves a wide range of businesses across the electronics sector, supporting customers who need prototype runs as well as ongoing production volumes.

