UPDATE companies SET description='The company expanded to St. Louis in 2005, adding a distribution center that enabled national chain fulfillment. In 2017 the business was acquired by Innovative Foodservice Group, though the Mosburg family remains involved in daily operations. Today the firm operates cash‑and‑carry showrooms in both Kansas City, Kansas, and St. Louis, Missouri.

