UPDATE companies SET description='BCI''s Sioux Falls division operates from a facility at 4501 North 2nd Avenue in Sioux Falls, South Dakota. The division traces its roots to 1975 when it was established as a leader in custom corrugated packaging across the upper Midwest and Central Plains. Buckeye Corrugated (BCI) acquired the operation in 2013, and it is now led by General Manager Chad Sabers alongside a management team that includes Area Vice President Adam Williams, Region Sales Manager Nic Poshusta, Controller Mary Jo Galles, and Creative and Client Services Manager Vladimir Sobolev.

