UPDATE companies SET description='The firm designs and sells renewable energy equipment, including solar modules, wind turbines, micro-hydro turbines, and all balance-of-system components. It assembles custom-built solar panel system kits and creates custom-designed solar power system plans, offering free system design and lifetime technical support. The team uses firsthand experience living off-grid to tailor each system, avoiding pre-packaged kits in favor of one-on-one consultation with customers and installers.

