UPDATE companies SET description='Barker Manufacturing Co. was founded in 1953 by James Barker in Battle Creek, Michigan. The company has remained family-owned and locally operated since its inception, building a reputation for high-quality engineering and craftsmanship in the recreational vehicle market.

The company specializes in the custom design and manufacture of RV components, including Tote-Alongs, power jacks (VIP 3000, VIP 3500, Hi-Power 3500), slidewinders, auto-drains, snaps, VentStiks, fresh water tank kits, fifth-wheel leg levelers, and accessories. Barker also produces custom-designed replacement parts for vintage and older-model RVs. All products are designed and manufactured in-house in the United States.

The company’s product line covers a broad range of RV systems, from leveling and stabilization to water management and ventilation.

Barker emphasizes a commitment to “doing things the right way,” meaning it designs, manufactures, and ships only products it is comfortable putting its name on. The company backs its products with warranties and responsive customer service, positioning its “Made in the USA” heritage as a core differentiator.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom design and manufacturing of RV components", "Vintage RV replacement parts manufacturing", "Engineering design", "Customer support and warranty service", "In-house manufacturing"], "industries": ["Recreational Vehicle (RV)", "RV aftermarket parts"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Made in the USA", "Family-owned and locally operated since 1953", "Custom design and manufacturing of RV components in-house", "Comprehensive warranties and responsive customer service", "Vintage RV replacement parts manufacturing"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1953 by James Barker -> /about", "Family-owned and locally operated -> /about", "Headquartered in Battle Creek, Michigan -> /about", "Specializes in custom design and manufacture of RV components -> /", "Product lines: Tote-Alongs, Power Jacks, Slidewinders, Auto-Drains, Snaps, VentStiks, Fresh Water Tank Kits, 5th Wheel Leg Levelers, Accessories, Vintage RV Parts -> /", "Made in the USA -> /", "Excellent warranties and responsive customer service -> /about", "Commitment to doing things the right way -> /about", "Company of engineers with high-quality craftsmanship -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Barker specializes in the custom design and manufacture of RV components, including top-of-the-line Tote-Alongs and Power Jacks, proudly made right here in the USA.", "founded_year": "1953", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updat